 Dagger", "description_zh": "幽鬼掷出一把匕首，留下一条暗影之径，对路径上的敌人造成伤害并减缓其移动速度。被匕首击中的单位移动时也会留下暗影之径。幽鬼在暗影之径上移速提升，并且可以无视地形移动。", "description_en": "Spectre flings a dagger to draw a Shadow Path, dealing damage and slowing the movement speed of any enemies along the trail. Units hit by the dagger also trail a Shadow Path. While treading the path, Spectre moves faster and phases through otherwise impassable terrain.", "notes_zh": ["在离开暗影之径后%dagger_grace_period%秒内碰撞体积依然为0，作为缓冲时间。", "不会触发法术抵抗或法术反弹。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "bonus_movespeed", "dagger_path_duration", "hero_path_duration", "buff_persistence", "dagger_radius", "path_radius", "vision_radius", "speed", "dagger_grace_period", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "spectre_shadow_step", "name_zh": "幽鬼·如影随形", "name_en": "Shadow Step", "description_zh": "对目标制造一个无法控制的幻象，对其进行攻击。子技能空降可以将本体传送至幻象，并将其摧毁。", "description_en": "Sends an uncontrollable illusion at a target that follows and attacks the target.The Reality sub-ability may be used to teleport to the illusion, destroying it.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "illusion_damage_incoming", "tooltip_illusion_total_damage_incoming", "illusion_outgoing_damage", "move_speed", "bonus_move_speed_illusion_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "spectre_dispersion", "name_zh": "幽鬼·折射", "name_en": "Dispersion", "description_zh": "幽灵会分散对她造成的部分伤害，将其反弹给附近的所有敌人。敌人离她越远，受到的伤害越低。", "description_en": "Spectre disperses part of the damage dealt to her, reflecting it to all nearby enemies. The effect lessens with distance.", "notes_zh": ["幽鬼本身不承受被折射的伤害。", "幻象并不继承此技能。", "伤害在减免前折射，并且折射的伤害与原伤害类型相同。", "这个技能造成的伤害被视为反弹伤害。反弹伤害不提供任何吸血，而且无法反弹。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "折射可以主动施放，吸收和反弹的伤害比例提升%activation_bonus_pct%%%，持续%activation_duration%秒。冷却时间为%activation_cooldown%秒。魔法消耗为%activation_manacost%点。", "en": "Dispersion can be activated to increase the amount absorbed and reflected by Dispersion by %activation_bonus_pct%%% of its base values for %activation_duration%s. Cooldown %activation_cooldown%. Manacost %activation_manacost%."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["damage_reflection_pct", "min_radius", "max_radius", "activation_cooldown", "activation_manacost", "activation_bonus_pct", "activation_duration"]}, {"subject": "spectre_desolate", "name_zh": "幽鬼·荒芜", "name_en": "Desolate", "description_zh": "当敌人附近%radius%范围内没有他们的友军时，幽鬼和她的幻象的攻击对他们造成额外纯粹伤害。", "description_en": "Spectre and her illusions deal bonus Pure damage if attacking an enemy that does not have any allied units within a %radius% radius around them.", "notes_zh": ["伤害在幽鬼攻击前产生。", "幽鬼的幻象继承荒芜。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["bonus_damage", "radius", "illusion_damage_outgoing"]}, {"subject": "spectre_haunt", "name_zh": "幽鬼·鬼影重重", "name_en": "Haunt", "description_zh": "创造一个复仇鬼影分别攻击每个敌方英雄。鬼影无法控制，受到额外伤害，造成的伤害低于幽鬼本体。鬼影移动无视地形。子技能空降可以将本体传送至幻象，并将其摧毁。", "description_en": "Creates a spectral nemesis to haunt all enemy Heroes.Haunt illusions are uncontrollable, take extra damage, and deal less damage than Spectre herself.  They ignore terrain.The Reality sub-ability may be used to teleport to the illusion, destroying it.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "幽鬼第一次对鬼影重重的幻象使用空降时，目标附近%fear_aoe%范围内的敌人会被恐惧，朝远离幽鬼的方向奔跑%fear_duration%秒，并且移动速度降低%fear_movespeed_slow%%%。冷却时间减少%scepter_cooldown_reduction_tooltip%秒。", "en": "The first time Spectre uses Reality on a Haunt illusion, enemies in a %fear_aoe% area around the target are Feared away from Spectre for %fear_duration%s and have their movement speed slowed by %fear_movespeed_slow%%%.Reduces cooldown by %scepter_cooldown_reduction_tooltip%s."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["scepter_cooldown_reduction_tooltip", "duration", "illusion_damage_outgoing", "tooltip_outgoing", "illusion_damage_incoming", "tooltip_illusion_total_damage_incoming", "destroy_if_target_is_dead", "fear_duration", "fear_aoe", "fear_movespeed_slow", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "doom_bringer_devour", "name_zh": "末日使者·吞噬", "name_en": "Devour", "description_zh": "消化一个敌军或中立生物，获得其特殊技能。开启多样施法（右键点击技能栏图标）后，末日使者不会获得其技能。持续时间与冷却时间相同。", "description_en": "Consumes an enemy or neutral creep, acquiring any special abilities that it possessed. If alt-cast is activated, Doom will not acquire the creep's abilities. Duration is equal to the cooldown.", "notes_zh": ["末日使者将获得该生物的正常金钱，还有技能的额外金钱。", "如果吞噬的单位没有技能，之前获得的技能将会保留。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "吞噬拥有%AbilityCharges%点能量点数，能以远古生物为目标。获得的野怪技能拥有%bonus_aoe_pct%%%额外作用范围和%bonus_spell_amp_pct%%%额外技能增强。", "en": "Devour has %AbilityCharges% charges and can target Ancients. Stolen creep abilities have %bonus_aoe_pct%%% increased AoE and %bonus_spell_amp_pct%%% increased spell amplification."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["bonus_gold", "creep_level", "hero_ability_steal_time", "can_target_ancient", "bonus_aoe_pct", "bonus_spell_amp_pct", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityCharges", "AbilityChargeRestoreTime", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "doom_bringer_scorched_earth", "name_zh": "末日使者·焦土", "name_en": "Scorched Earth", "description_zh": "用火焰覆盖周围的土地，对敌人造成伤害，同时末日使者的移动速度和生命恢复得到提升。", "description_en": "Carpets the nearby earth in flames which damage enemies, while also granting Doom increased movement speed and health regeneration.", "notes_zh": ["焦土会跟随末日使者，以他所在位置为中心。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_per_second", "bonus_health_regen", "radius", "bonus_movement_speed_pct", "duration", "is_permanent", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "doom_bringer_infernal_blade", "name_zh": "末日使者·阎刃", "name_en": "Infernal Blade", "description_zh": "末日挥舞他的炽烈之剑，将敌人点燃。造成%ministun_duration%秒眩晕，并施加一个燃烧效果，持续%burn_duration%秒，每秒造成伤害，数值为基础伤害+目标最大生命值的一定百分比。", "description_en": "Doom swings his burning sword, igniting the enemy. Stuns for %ministun_duration% seconds and applies a %burn_duration% second burn that deals a base damage plus a percentage of the target's Max HP as damage per second.", "notes_zh": ["可以打断持续施法类技能。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["burn_damage", "burn_damage_pct", "burn_duration", "ministun_duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "doom_bringer_doom", "name_zh": "末日使者·末日", "name_en": "Doom", "description_zh": "对敌人施加末日诅咒，对其进行驱散，并且使其无法施放技能或获得任何治疗效果，同时造成持续伤害。\n\n驱散类型：弱驱散", "description_en": "Inflicts a curse that dispels an enemy and prevents them from casting spells or healing in any way, while taking damage over time.\n\nDISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "末日对敌人施加破坏效果。末日作用下目标%scepter_aura_radius%范围内友军也会受到末日的作用。可以对自身施放末日，使末日作用于末日使者周围的敌人。", "en": "Doom applies Break to enemies. Allies in a %scepter_aura_radius% radius around the doomed target also suffer the effects of Doom. Allows Doom to be self-cast to affect enemies around himself with Doom."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["duration", "damage", "deniable_pct", "does_break", "does_mute", "scepter_aura_radius", "applies_dispel_to_self", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "doom_bringer_lvl_pain", "name_zh": "末日使者·等级？痛苦", "name_en": "Lvl ? Pain", "description_zh": "末日使者的攻击会诅咒敌方英雄。%damage_debuff_duration%秒后，被诅咒的英雄会爆发出一根火柱，对自身和%spread_radius%范围内所有敌方单位造成伤害，伤害量为诅咒期间内承受来自末日使者的%bonus_damage_pct_base%%%伤害。如果被诅咒的英雄等级为%level_multiplier%的倍数，诅咒的伤害和作用范围会提升%bonus_at_level_pct%%%。", "description_en": "Doom's attacks curse enemy heroes. After %damage_debuff_duration%s, the cursed hero bursts with a pillar of fire, damaging itself and all units in a %spread_radius% AoE for %bonus_damage_pct_base%%% of the damage taken from Doom during the curse. The damage and radius of the curse is %bonus_at_level_pct%%% stronger if the enemy's level is a multiple of %level_multiplier%.", "notes_zh": ["末日使者达到满级后也会生效。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["bonus_damage_pct_base", "damage_debuff_duration", "spread_radius", "level_multiplier", "bonus_at_level_pct"]}, {"subject": "ancient_apparition_cold_feet", "name_zh": "远古冰魄·寒霜之足", "name_en": "Cold Feet", "description_zh": "对一个敌人施加诅咒，造成持续伤害。如果目标没有在%AbilityDuration%秒内远离初始地点走出足够距离，那么将被眩晕并冻在原地。", "description_en": "Places a curse on an enemy, dealing damage over time.  If the enemy unit doesn't move outside of the given range from the initial location, it will be stunned and frozen in place after %AbilityDuration% seconds.", "notes_zh": ["每0.5秒造成一次伤害。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_per_second", "break_distance", "stun_duration", "area_of_effect", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "ancient_apparition_ice_vortex", "name_zh": "远古冰魄·冰霜漩涡", "name_en": "Ice Vortex", "description_zh": "创造一个寒冰能量的漩涡，对范围内敌人造成伤害和减速，并增加他们受到的魔法伤害。", "description_en": "Creates a vortex of icy energy that slows, deals damage, and increases magic damage done to enemies in its range.", "notes_zh": ["提供放置地点的小片视野。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "drag_speed", "movement_speed_pct", "spell_resist_pct", "vision_aoe", "damage_per_second", "vortex_duration", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityDuration", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "ancient_apparition_chilling_touch", "name_zh": "远古冰魄·极寒之触", "name_en": "Chilling Touch", "description_zh": "使自己的普通攻击附带距离提升，高额魔法伤害和减速效果。", "description_en": "Enhances Ancient Apparition's attack with increased range and a burst of magical damage and slow.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "移除了冷却时间。", "en": "Removes cooldown."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage", "duration", "slow", "slow_duration", "attack_range_bonus", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "ancient_apparition_bone_chill", "name_zh": "远古冰魄·刺骨严寒", "name_en": "Bone Chill", "description_zh": "每当远古冰魄通过他的技能对敌人造成魔法伤害，敌人就会减速一段时间。如果目标是英雄，力量还会降低。多个本效果会叠加，并且持续时间相互独立。", "description_en": "When Ancient Apparition deals Magic damage to an enemy with his abilities, it is slowed for a short duration. If the target is a Hero, its Strength is also reduced. Multiple instances of this effect stack and have independent durations.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "基础力量降低提升%tooltip_scepter_bonus%。", "en": "Increases Base Strength Reduction by %tooltip_scepter_bonus%."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["str_reduction", "tooltip_scepter_bonus", "str_reduction_duration", "movement_slow_pct"]}]
